<h1>Gaps</h1>
<div class="sub">What the model and the gate can already point at. Each card says whether it comes from the shipped gate or is a check this explorer adds.</div>
<div class="grid two page">
{{#cards}}<div class="card gap"><h3>{{{title}}} <span class="count">{{{count}}}</span> <span class="pill{{#isGate}} gate{{/isGate}}">{{{source}}}</span></h3><div class="sub small why">{{{whyHtml}}}</div>{{{bodyHtml}}}</div>
{{/cards}}</div>
